From: DockSeed <dockseed@proton.me>
Subject: [PATCH] aic8800_fdrv: do not advertise monitor mode, which this build
 cannot run

The driver is built without CONFIG_RWNX_MON_DATA and CONFIG_RWNX_MON_XMIT
but lists NL80211_IFTYPE_MONITOR in wiphy->interface_modes. With one vif
(or the guard bypassed), "iw dev wl0 set type monitor" on an associated
interface led to a NULL pointer oops in rwnx_rxdataind_aicwf(), where
skb_monitor is set only under CONFIG_RWNX_MON_DATA, and the rx thread
ended. rwnx_netdev_monitor_ops also has no ndo_start_xmit without
CONFIG_RWNX_MON_XMIT.

Remove NL80211_IFTYPE_MONITOR from interface_modes. cfg80211 then
refuses a change to monitor and a new monitor interface with
-EOPNOTSUPP before the driver is called. custchan=1 depends on monitor
mode and is rejected at wiphy setup with an error message. The monitor
code itself is not changed.

Assisted-by: Claude

diff --git a/src/USB/driver_fw/drivers/aic8800/aic8800_fdrv/rwnx_main.c b/src/USB/driver_fw/drivers/aic8800/aic8800_fdrv/rwnx_main.c
index e040622..8e6c37e 100644
--- a/src/USB/driver_fw/drivers/aic8800/aic8800_fdrv/rwnx_main.c
+++ b/src/USB/driver_fw/drivers/aic8800/aic8800_fdrv/rwnx_main.c
@@ -9218,6 +9218,15 @@ if((g_rwnx_plat->usbdev->chipid == PRODUCT_ID_AIC8801) ||
 		}
 	}
 
+    /*
+     * NL80211_IFTYPE_MONITOR is not advertised. This build has neither
+     * CONFIG_RWNX_MON_DATA nor CONFIG_RWNX_MON_XMIT, and its monitor paths
+     * crash: the monitor netdev has no ndo_start_xmit, and a monitor frame
+     * that also carries another rx status dereferences a NULL skb in
+     * rwnx_rxdataind_aicwf. cfg80211 refuses a type the wiphy does not
+     * advertise before the driver is called (cfg80211_change_iface,
+     * nl80211 new_interface).
+     */
     wiphy->interface_modes =
     BIT(NL80211_IFTYPE_STATION)     |
     BIT(NL80211_IFTYPE_AP)          |
@@ -9229,7 +9238,13 @@ if((g_rwnx_plat->usbdev->chipid == PRODUCT_ID_AIC8801) ||
     BIT(NL80211_IFTYPE_P2P_DEVICE)  |
     #endif
     #endif
-    BIT(NL80211_IFTYPE_MONITOR);
+    0;
+
+    /* custchan switches the wiphy to monitor-only, see above */
+    if (rwnx_mod_params.custchan) {
+        wiphy_err(wiphy, "custchan needs monitor mode, which this build does not support; ignored\n");
+        rwnx_mod_params.custchan = false;
+    }
 
 #if defined CONFIG_GPIO_WAKEUP || defined CONFIG_WOWLAN
 		/* Set WoWLAN flags */
